  "cli_result_text": "Submitted the 17 files that make up the full impact surface of the RealmExport migration:\n\n**Schema / migration core**\n- `zerver/models/realm_audit_logs.py` \u2014 current `RealmAuditLog` + `AuditLogEventType.REALM_EXPORTED`, whose `extra_data` JSON field (`export_path`, `started_timestamp`, `failed_timestamp`, `deleted_timestamp`) is the \"JSON tracking\" being replaced\n- `zerver/models/__init__.py` \u2014 model registry the new `RealmExport` import must be added to\n- `zerver/models/realms.py` \u2014 export-type constants (`EXPORT_PUBLIC`, `EXPORT_FULL_WITH_CONSENT`, `EXPORT_FULL_WITHOUT_CONSENT`)\n\n**Direct references**\n- `zerver/actions/realm_export.py` \u2014 `notify_realm_export`, `do_delete_realm_export`\n- `zerver/views/realm_export.py` \u2014 `export_realm`, `get_realm_exports`, `delete_realm_export`, `get_users_export_consents`\n- `zproject/urls.py` \u2014 URL wiring for those views\n\n**Indirect / tentacles**\n- `zerver/worker/deferred_work.py` \u2014 background worker that runs the export and mutates `extra_data`\n- `zerver/management/commands/export.py` \u2014 CLI export command\n- `zerver/lib/export.py` \u2014 core export logic incl. `get_realm_exports_serialized`\n- `zerver/lib/upload/__init__.py` \u2014 `upload_export_tarball`/`delete_export_tarball`\n- `zerver/lib/events.py` + `zerver/lib/event_schema.py` \u2014 realm_export event handling/schema\n- `zerver/openapi/python_examples.py` \u2014 API doc examples exercising these endpoints\n\n**Test coverage**\n- `zerver/tests/test_realm_export.py`, `test_import_export.py`, `test_events.py`, `test_management_commands.py`",
